{
  "schemaVersion": "0.1.0",
  "name": "小红书｜知识收件箱",
  "behavior": "create",
  "noteNameFormat": "{{selector:#detail-title|safe_name}}",
  "path": "Clippings",
  "context": "{{selectorHtml:#noteContainer|markdown}}",
  "properties": [
    {
      "name": "type",
      "value": "social-material",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "name": "platform",
      "value": "小红书",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "name": "source",
      "value": "{{url}}",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "name": "author",
      "value": "{{selector:#noteContainer > .author .username}}",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "name": "published",
      "value": "{{selector:#noteContainer .note-content .date}}",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "name": "created",
      "value": "{{date|date:\"YYYY-MM-DD\"}}",
      "type": "date"
    },
    {
      "name": "account",
      "value": "待判断",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "name": "process-status",
      "value": "待处理",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "name": "tags",
      "value": "clippings, 小红书",
      "type": "multitext"
    }
  ],
  "triggers": [
    "https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/",
    "https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/"
  ],
  "noteContentFormat": "# {{selector:#detail-title}}\n\n## 一、原始信息\n\n> 作者：{{selector:#noteContainer > .author .username}}\n> 发布：{{selector:#noteContainer .note-content .date}}\n> 来源：[查看原文]({{url}})\n\n## 二、原始内容\n\n### 2.1 作者正文\n\n{{selectorHtml:#detail-desc|markdown}}\n\n### 2.2 原始图片 / 视频\n\n{{selectorHtml:#noteContainer .media-container|markdown}}\n\n### 2.3 原始评论\n\n{{selectorHtml:#noteContainer .comments-container|markdown}}\n\n## 三、我的收藏理由\n\n\n## 四、AI 处理区\n\n> [!todo] 等待知识沉淀 Skill 处理。\n"
}
